# Optional. The Omarchy installer uses a systemd *system* timer instead,
# which is more reliable than a user crontab (runs when logged out).
#
# Installer: ./scripts/install-omarchy.sh
# Status:    ./scripts/timer-status.sh
#
# If you still want cronie:
#   0 12 * * * REPO_ROOT/scripts/run-renewal.sh
